      "content": "i know about hotlines. i've tried. they just give you more words to process, more things to listen to. more noise. it's just another thing to deal with. i'm not looking for a way to \"manage\" it anymore. i'm just looking for an end to it. like, how do you actually find that kind of absolute, perfect silence? the kind where nothing can reach you ever again?",
